// The out-of-thin-air shape that value narrowing used to launder.
//
// MoRDor's own test, for #43. Thread 2 re-reads z after writing it, so `R z` is
// forwarded from `W z r2` and elided. The write of x that follows is then
// justified by ValueAssignElab as `W x 0` -- a constant, needing no dependency
// -- while the execution went on recording the symbolic value the read had.
// With no dp edge into that write the cycle
//
//     x -> r1 -> y -> r2 -> z -> r3 -> x
//
// was broken at its last step and the forbidden outcome had a witness.
//
// The execution now carries the value its justification licensed, so the two
// cannot come apart. avoidoota/listing16.lit is the same shape from the MRD
// listings; this one states the isolation directly.
x := 0; y := 0; z := 0;
{
  r1 := x;
  y := r1
}|||{
  r2 := y;
  z := r2;
  r3 := z;
  x := r3
}
%% forbid (r1 = 17 && r2 = 17 && r3 = 17) []
